part of the governments in the world is still reluctant to address these systems as gambling, as well as to take measures against them. Inquest is an independent magazine that analyzes the subtle mechanics developed by the industry, for the purpose of making the consumers aware.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>The series is formed by four issues, each one addressing one particular gambling trick used by the industry. Issue 0, the one that was fully designed and printed, focuses on loot boxes.\u003C/p>\n                \u003Cdiv data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cvideo data-deferred preload=\"none\" poster=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" data-src=\"/media/inquest-all-pages.webm\" data-autoplay muted loop playsinline>\u003C/video>\u003Cnoscript>\u003Cvideo controls preload=\"none\" poster=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" src=\"/media/inquest-all-pages.webm\" muted loop playsinline>\u003C/video>\u003C/noscript>\u003C/div>\n              \n        \u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"inquest-pages.jpg\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/media/inquest-pages.jpg\" width=\"1920\" />\u003C/span>\n      \n        \u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"inquest-visualization.jpg\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/media/inquest-visualization.jpg\" width=\"1920\" />\u003C/span>\n      \n        \u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"inquest-inner-pages-1.jpg\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/media/inquest-inner-pages-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\" />\u003C/span>\n      \n        \u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"inquest-inner-pages-2.jpg\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/media/inquest-inner-pages-2.jpg\" width=\"1920\" />\u003C/span>\n   